{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/1402","tmdb_id":1402,"title":"行尸走肉","original_title":"The Walking Dead","overview":"镇治安官瑞克·格莱姆斯在一次行动中遭受枪击，当他从昏迷中醒来时，发现小镇上阴气沉沉，死尸遍地。更为恐怖的是，有的死尸游走于街头巷尾，嗜血如命，早已化作恐怖的丧尸。从一对幸存的父子口中得知，大批的幸存者早已疏散到亚特兰大市的避难所。为了 找到失踪的妻儿，瑞克只身上路。然而亚特兰大早已沦陷成为死城，丧尸在此占有绝对的统治地位。被丧尸围攻的瑞克得到数名幸存者的救助，经过一番奋力厮杀，他们最终返回到野外的营地。在接下来的日子里，他们不仅要面临丧尸的威胁，更要承受来自灵魂深处的巨大考验……","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwmHfcb7h8wMndRcAQixvvGSVth.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAOjnEFTuNysY7bot8zonhImGMh.jpg","first_air_date":"2010-10-31","last_air_date":"2022-11-20","year":"2010","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":177,"number_of_seasons":11,"tmdb_rating_average":8.1,"tmdb_votes":18012,"tmdb_rating":"8.1 / 10 from 18012 users","genres":["动作冒险","剧情","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"languages":["English"],"countries":["United States of America"],"production_companies":["AMC Studios","Circle of Confusion","Valhalla Motion Pictures","Darkwoods Productions","Skybound Entertainment","Idiotbox"],"directors":[],"producers":[],"cast":[{"id":62220,"name":"劳伦·科汉","original_name":"Lauren Cohan","character":"Maggie Greene","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/8WPbj506873QzrKwUFbjjniLuvD.jpg"},{"id":4886,"name":"诺曼·瑞杜斯","original_name":"Norman Reedus","character":"Daryl Dixon","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/ozHPdO5jAt7ozzdZUgyRAMNPSDW.jpg"},{"id":47296,"name":"杰弗里·迪恩·摩根","original_name":"Jeffrey Dean Morgan","character":"Negan Smith","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/m8bdrmh6ExDCGQ64E83mHg002YV.jpg"},{"id":31535,"name":"梅丽莎·麦克布莱德","original_name":"Melissa McBride","character":"Carol Peletier","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/2omPfeMdnicJqqvgKAU2iqVyD4Z.jpg"},{"id":84224,"name":"克里斯蒂安·塞拉托斯","original_name":"Christian Serratos","character":"Rosita Espinosa","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/jP07Elhu2eZdmjIB4fJiag5CfaD.jpg"},{"id":41688,"